SUMMARY:Meet the Rescues! at That Fish Place
DESCRIPTION:Come out to our LARGEST rescue event of the year!\nWe are hosting many local animal organizations showcasing adoptable animals and\, of course\, providing information to you about their amazing group.\nJoin us for a fun day! You might even meet your new best friend!\nAttending Rescues & Organizations:\n\nOperation Scarlet\nCharlie’s Crusaders\nBlind Dog Rescue Alliance\nOslo Project\nAcorn Acres\nCenterville Pet Rescue\nSave a Yorkie Rescue\nReptile Invasion\nHomeless to Home Husky Rescue\nFeathered Sanctuary\nPass the Cabbage\nGuardian Angels for Soldier’s Pets\nColumbia Animal Shelter\nS.N.O.R.T. Short Noses Only Rescue\nJesse & Forgotten Friend\nKrazy Kritters Co\nCocoa Kitties\n& The Dog House Grill Food Truck!\n\n\n\nAdditional Shopping & Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nAmish Products\nConsignment and Thrift Shops\nFarmers Markets\nFurniture\n\n\n\nQuilt Supplies and Fabrics\nGifts & Collectibles\nTheater\, Music\, & the Arts\nKids’ Attractions\nAdults & Couples\n\n\n\nRailroad Attractions\nHistorical & Educational\nZip-Lines\n\n\nEvents Calendar
